wrong: `energy = m * 9e16`, `text = f"{energy:.2e}"`.

=== task: code hard
title: Average Speed Shown
patterns: make + show
prompt: A trip of `km` kilometres took `minutes` minutes, and both are already set. Create `text` like `"45.0 km/h"`: the average speed in kilometres per hour with 1 decimal, a space and `km/h`.

